<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks flat at 213,255.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks flat at 213,255.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of May 20 totaled 213,255 bales, unchanged from the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, 540 bales awaiting review, no cancellations, and 6,515 decertification orders.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
